# ML training environment + model artifacts. The trained ONNX model is
# committed under public/models/ for the PWA; the models/ working dir holds
# checkpoints, the fp32 ONNX export, fusion probes, and metrics - all
# reproducible via scripts/train_classifier.py + scripts/export_onnx.py.
.venv-train/
/models/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
